==Acquisition==
The mod can be bought from [[Son]] for {{sc|20,000}} after reaching '''Rank 3 - Associate''' with the [[Entrati]].

==Notes==
*Each hit will remove '''15%''' armor from the hit enemy. If the enemy was damaged by an ability within the past '''10''' seconds, each melee hit by the companion will also cause enemies within '''9''' meters of the hit enemy to have 15% of their armor removed.
*The only [[Sentinel]] weapon that counts as a melee attack is {{Weapon|Deconstructor}} and {{Weapon|Deconstructor Prime}}, but it can only be used by {{Companion|Helios}} and {{Companion|Helios Prime}}.
*Shockwaves from {{M|Seismic Bond}} will not trigger the armor strip. 
*"Abilities" refers to those used by either your Warframe or operator/drifter.
**Damage from [[Exalted Weapon|Exalted weapons]] does not count.
**Damage from Companion precept abilities do not count.


==Tips==
*Synergizes well with {{M|Swipe}}, as the armor stripping effects will trigger for each target.

